1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,284
This paper,

2
00:00:02,342 --> 00:00:03,349
he made it.

3
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:05,435
Liuxi paper?

4
00:00:06,093 --> 00:00:06,926
I'm Xu Yan, your student.

5
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:07,884
Please stand as my guarantor.

6
00:00:08,316 --> 00:00:09,682
A guarantor pulling out before the exam?

7
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,232
There's a reason.

8
00:00:11,682 --> 00:00:13,343
The ink doesn't bleed,

9
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:14,994
and the man who made it doesn't cheat.

10
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:16,125
Good.

11
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:18,078
Then I'll test you.

12
00:00:18,269 --> 00:00:19,959
A drought year, no rain:

13
00:00:20,027 --> 00:00:22,325
how do the fields get water?

14
00:00:22,388 --> 00:00:23,827
The river's down low,

15
00:00:23,887 --> 00:00:25,193
the fields are up high.

16
00:00:25,443 --> 00:00:26,639
So let the water

17
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:28,230
climb up on its own.

18
00:00:28,296 --> 00:00:30,390
Liuxi tore down the shrine's beams

19
00:00:30,457 --> 00:00:31,353
and built this waterwheel.

20
00:00:31,812 --> 00:00:33,426
Water in Liuxi…

21
00:00:33,487 --> 00:00:35,021
so it was you.

22
00:00:35,078 --> 00:00:35,620
This bond,

23
00:00:36,072 --> 00:00:37,679
I'll stand for it.

24
00:00:39,827 --> 00:00:41,346
H-Headmaster Cheng?

25
00:00:41,713 --> 00:00:43,855
You pull a bond without asking why?

26
00:00:43,937 --> 00:00:45,622
Is that how you do your job?

27
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:47,308
My mistake, sir!

28
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:48,424
I'll fix it now!

29
00:00:48,515 --> 00:00:50,271
Some nobody from Qingshui County,

30
00:00:50,339 --> 00:00:52,278
and the headmaster vouches for him?

31
00:00:52,381 --> 00:00:54,232
See you in the exam.

32
00:01:00,539 --> 00:01:01,999
Those clothes…

33
00:01:02,113 --> 00:01:03,487
he's one of the Wei men.

34
00:01:03,644 --> 00:01:04,750
I won't forget you.

35
00:01:07,258 --> 00:01:07,713
Sir,

36
00:01:07,772 --> 00:01:08,891
the roof's leaking.

37
00:01:09,322 --> 00:01:10,110
No changing cells.

38
00:01:10,402 --> 00:01:11,281
Figure it out yourself.

39
00:01:11,514 --> 00:01:11,992
Leak away.

40
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:13,805
Soak me, fine,

41
00:01:13,988 --> 00:01:15,272
but not the paper.

42
00:01:17,992 --> 00:01:18,566
Papers in!

43
00:01:18,664 --> 00:01:20,520
All three sessions of the provincial exam:

44
00:01:20,588 --> 00:01:21,855
complete.

45
00:01:24,701 --> 00:01:27,193
Qingshui County,

46
00:01:27,263 --> 00:01:28,068
Xu Yan.

47
00:01:30,506 --> 00:01:31,802
Fine writing.

48
00:01:31,862 --> 00:01:33,767
What a shame.

49
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,500
From today on,

50
00:01:36,972 --> 00:01:39,156
your name is Wei Xun.
